{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15106950","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15106950","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1510695001:0":{"text":"Sarethiel, why did you destroy Tuttleton?","source_cn":"丰饶神，你为何要覆灭图塔镇？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB7E12E1F4AB0610","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1510695002:1":{"text":"Silence! Those wretched mortals! Their fates are mine to decide!","source_cn":"住嘴！那群卑贱的凡人，生与死皆由我来定夺！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52938618CD943523","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1510695003:0":{"text":"Fallen god, you have no right to take mortal lives as you please. Their innocent souls aren't your sustenance.","source_cn":"堕落的神明，你无权随意剥夺凡人的生命，他们无辜的灵魂不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36F6ACE4B2FC28ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1510695004:1":{"text":"I gave them blessed rain and bountiful harvests. But they repaid me with betrayal!","source_cn":"我降下甘霖，赐予他们丰收。是他们背叛了我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x805A238197969430","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1510695005:0":{"text":"Mortals should have offered me their devout faith, and eased the pain of my fall... Instead, they dared to <style=\"highlight\">weave a banishing ritual against me</style>! The god who took care of this land like a father!","source_cn":"凡人本该献上虔诚的信仰，助我从堕落的痛苦中恢复……他们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x127C7281906007CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1510695006:1":{"text":"Such insolence... Death and destruction are the bitter fruits they deserve!","source_cn":"这般忘恩负义……死亡与毁灭是他们应咽的苦果！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07DDC5406A8AD8C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1510695007:0":{"text":"... He's utterly insane.","source_cn":"……如此疯狂。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC5C11BDF6E9511B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1510695008:0":{"text":"Insects. Your powers are but dying sparks in the dark void, the axioms you worship are but a fragile spider's web. You hold up a firefly and dare to call it the sun!","source_cn":"蝼蚁，你们的力量仅是深黯中的微光，追捧的真理不过是纤细...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1AF2085993084A1A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1510695009:1":{"text":"I am a thousand times greater than you!","source_cn":"我更胜你们千万筹！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80C9287AC7932065","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1510695010:1":{"text":"A true god... So this is the power of a fallen god...!","source_cn":"神……这就是堕神的力量……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43DA76B59D4E1165","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1510695011:0":{"text":"... Divine <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>! I'll protect you!","source_cn":"……<style=stress><player_nam...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5C373F26C2071BDF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"... Divine <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>! I'll protect you!","female":"... Divine <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>! I'll protect you!","variant_male_record_index":"175051","variant_female_record_index":"175052","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:18:1510695011":{"text":"... Divine <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>! I'll protect you!","source_cn":"……<style=stress><player_name></style>大人！我会保护您！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5C373F26C2071BDF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"... Divine <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>! I'll protect you!","female":"... Divine <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>! I'll protect you!","variant_male_record_index":"175051","variant_female_record_index":"175052","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1510695012:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA208393C3B8812F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","do